      "body": "`HeapSlot::alloc_large` is currently commented out, but it is called by the OSDK heap allocator (e.g. `osdk/deps/heap-allocator/src/allocator.rs` uses `HeapSlot::alloc_large(...)`). This is an API/compile break for downstream crates. If large allocations are intentionally unsupported during verification, keep the method but provide a stub/external body instead of removing it from the API surface.",
