      "body": "`Slab::dealloc` is currently stubbed to always log an ownership error and return `Err(AllocError)`, which makes successful deallocation impossible. Downstream allocators expect `dealloc` to return slots back into the slab (e.g. OSDK heap allocator deallocates into slabs). If this is a verification-only stub, it should be cfg-gated so non-verify builds keep correct deallocation semantics.",
